Bundled fallback fonts (enabled only with the `cjk-form-fonts` cargo feature)
=============================================================================

These fonts are embedded to bake non-Latin / emoji form-field values when an
interactive form is flattened. They are redistributed under their original
open-source licenses. Font binaries and their embedded notices are unchanged.

